UnitSimpleActionsFactory::createSimpleActions
└── when creating a SimpleActions contract
    ├── it should deploy a SimpleActions contract with correct args
    └── it should match the parameters sent to the constructor
    └── it should set the factory address in the child contract
    └── it should store the contract in the factory

UnitSimpleActionsFactory::createSimpleAction
└── when creating a SimpleActions contract with a single simple action
    ├── it should deploy a SimpleActions contract with a single simple action args
    ├── it should match the parameters sent to the constructor
    └── it should set the factory address in the child contract
    └── it should store the contract in the factory
